  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with transformer aggregation (config_006) achieves the highest RNA-only accuracy (0.653). However, multimodal experiments (e.g., config_028) underperform, suggesting uncertainty about image data utility. This experiment tests whether combining scvi_n200 RNA with resnet50 image data using transformer aggregation (mirroring RNA-only success) and weighted fusion (a more sophisticated integration method) could bridge this gap. It isolates the effect of fusion strategy while leveraging proven RNA encoder and aggregation choices, addressing key uncertainty about multimodal effectiveness."
